1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:01,300
This lesson is for the

2
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:03,020
person managing the dealership's

3
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:04,040
AutoLander access.

4
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:05,610
Start in the left

5
00:00:05,610 --> 00:00:07,770
sidebar and click Configuration.

6
00:00:07,810 --> 00:00:09,250
Then choose Team.

7
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:11,040
Find the teammate's row.

8
00:00:11,410 --> 00:00:13,290
Posting Access and Manager

9
00:00:13,290 --> 00:00:14,610
Dashboard Access are

10
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:15,630
separate choices.

11
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:17,520
A rep who publishes

12
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:19,160
vehicles needs posting access.

13
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:21,480
A manager who only reviews

14
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:23,280
activity may need dashboard

15
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:24,960
access without posting access.

16
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:26,620
Match the settings

17
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:27,820
to that person's job.

18
00:00:28,380 --> 00:00:29,620
To add someone new,

19
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:30,960
choose Invite Member.

20
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:32,320
Enter the correct

21
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:33,460
email and the role

22
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:34,940
details shown in the form.

23
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:36,600
Check your plan's seat

24
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:37,940
arrangements before sending.

25
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:39,490
Each person should

26
00:00:39,490 --> 00:00:40,710
use their own login.

27
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:42,560
Ask the teammate to check

28
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:44,120
their inbox and spam folder,

29
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:45,600
then follow the invitation.

30
00:00:46,130 --> 00:00:47,150
Have them sign

31
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:48,180
in and show you

32
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:49,200
the page they need.

33
00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:50,520
That checks both

34
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:52,360
the invitation and their access.

35
00:00:52,640 --> 00:00:54,250
If a rep can't find

36
00:00:54,250 --> 00:00:55,930
the inventory or posting page,

37
00:00:56,050 --> 00:00:57,080
check their account

38
00:00:57,080 --> 00:00:58,100
and access first.

39
00:00:58,430 --> 00:00:59,890
Use the existing account

40
00:00:59,890 --> 00:01:01,410
instead of creating a duplicate.

41
00:01:01,410 --> 00:01:02,930
If the issue

42
00:01:02,930 --> 00:01:05,080
concerns seats or billing, check

43
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:06,380
the subscription separately.

44
00:01:06,720 --> 00:01:08,640
Now compare two roles

45
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:10,440
in your workbook: a posting

46
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:11,700
rep and a manager

47
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:13,260
who only reviews the team.

48
00:01:13,730 --> 00:01:14,990
Write down the access

49
00:01:14,990 --> 00:01:16,030
each one needs.

50
00:01:16,260 --> 00:01:17,830
Leave the live settings as

51
00:01:17,830 --> 00:01:19,210
they are during this exercise.
